},
{
"text": "[image: Join my friends @gabbygiffords @captmarkkelly @electmanka and me for a lively conversation about our work to save lives from #gunviolence & our the progress we have made together in Washington! 🧡 RSVP link in bio! @giffords_org]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DNG8R50TVWX/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Join us May 11 as we fight to keep Ballard Light Rail on track! 🚊🤺]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DXw7todDqDQ/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Seattle Center is the heart of my community. It’s where my neighbors gather and my children play. It’s a place for arts, sports, celebration and wandering. It is no place for violence. As we mourn the lives lost and forever changed by Sunday’s horrific events, I remain committed to working on solutions to keep our communities safe. Gun violence is preventable. 🧡]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbbCSpLRoMz/"
},
{
