{
"text": "[image: So so proud the Seattle/King Co Health Clinic is held @seattlecenter in #LD36 providing free medical/dental/vision care to almost 1,000 people every year! 🩺🦷👓]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DXndNLwGeNA/"
},
{
"text": "[image: The #ForestTrailhead @woodlandparkzoo is now open! What a beautiful addition to our community! 🌳🐼🦎🐢🦘 @jorgelbaron @noelframe @staterepjuliareed]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DXhot2Ej7tV/"
},
{
"text": "[image: This week I filed for reelection to the job I love - serving our community in the Washington State House of Representatives! 🌟 I’m running for reelection to continue the fight for fairness, elevate working families and children, and bring affordability back to our region. I will stand up for the progressive values that have guided me my whole life as a working mom, nonprofit executive, and proven leader who knows how to get things done. I’m so proud to represent you in Olympia. I’m honored to launch our campaign with the support of @pramilajayapal @bobferguson4wa @nickbrownnow & many other elected officials and orgs. Now let’s go, fight, win! 🫶🏻👊🏻🗳️✨🇺🇸]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DYAXenlCTfb/"
}
]
